#ASSERT `2015 c 13 s 39 section 380.4 as it read immediately before that day continues to apply to the statement` (Date 15 3 2020) (Date 15 3 2020) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `2015 c 13 s 39 section 380.4 as it read immediately before that day continues to apply to the statement` (Date 15 3 2020) (Date 16 3 2020) EQUALS NOTHING


-- 2015 c 13 s 40: the day is 2020-03-15; "on or after the day": the day itself is within.
