#ASSERT `2015 c 13 s 40 the conduct is within the limit on section 423.1` (Date 15 3 2020) (Date 16 3 2020) EQUALS JUST TRUE


-- 2015 c 13 s 41: the day is 2020-03-15; made before it -> continues to apply; on or after it -> NOT COVERED (never FALSE).
