#ASSERT `2015 c 13 s 41 section 672.5 as it read immediately before that day continues to apply to the statement` (Date 15 3 2020) (Date 15 3 2020) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `2015 c 13 s 41 section 672.5 as it read immediately before that day continues to apply to the statement` (Date 15 3 2020) (Date 16 3 2020) EQUALS NOTHING


-- 2015 c 13 s 42: the day is 2020-03-15; "on or after the day": the day itself is within.
#ASSERT `2015 c 13 s 42 the conduct is within the limit on the amendments to section 718` (Date 15 3 2020) (Date 14 3 2020) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `2015 c 13 s 42 the conduct is within the limit on the amendments to section 718` (Date 15 3 2020) (Date 15 3 2020) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `2015 c 13 s 42 the conduct is within the limit on the amendments to section 718` (Date 15 3 2020) (Date 16 3 2020) EQUALS JUST TRUE


