§ `2015 c. 20 s. 28 -- information deemed laid under subsection 810.011(1)`

#ASSERT `2015 c 20 s 28 the information is deemed to have been laid under subsection 810.011(1)` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Each limb failing is a failed "if": the text's no within the provision (a marginal reading).
#ASSERT `2015 c 20 s 28 the information is deemed to have been laid under subsection 810.011(1)` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `2015 c 20 s 28 the information is deemed to have been laid under subsection 810.011(1)` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `2015 c 20 s 28 the information is deemed to have been laid under subsection 810.011(1)` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
